      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Crystal Caverns, Fragment of Fear [zone=870]\n**Who:**\n- Graght the Little [npc=41296]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Ry`Gorr digger [npc=41608]\n- a Ry`Gorr miner [npc=41612]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:02:01 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Graght the Little ( map) at 500, 600, -274 (this is in the Ry'Gorr area, a long distance from the zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Graght the Little'\nGraght the Little says 'I have no time for the petty wants of a slave right now. If you need something, go get it. If you want something, take it by force - if you can. If you're sick or injured, go die in a corner where you won't be in anyone's way. I'm [busy]!'\nYou say, 'Busy with what?'\nGraght the Little glares at you threateningly, 'Can you not see I'm working? All the others taunt me and pick on me. They shove me and laugh, calling me a weakling, just because I'm inferior in size. Well I'll show them! I will mine more crystals than anyone, and force them all to acknowledge my strength! I'm just off to a [slow] start.\nYou say, 'A slow start?'\nGraght the Little says 'I need more crystals. No matter what I do, others always seem to mine more than I do.' His eyes narrow, as an idea occurs, 'But I think that changes now. Slave, go bring me more crystals! I don't care how you get them: dig, steal, or even kill - just bring me more!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Velium Mining Made Simple'.\nGraght has ordered you to collect crystal so that he can impress the other orcs. He doesn't care how you get them.\n\n---\n\nCollect at least 8 crystals from miners or diggers 0/8 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Note: There is no actual item here. It's a random update on kills._\n_Ry'Gorr Miners and Diggers are found in the zone-in area._\nReturn to Graght 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
