      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Crystal Caverns, Fragment of Fear [zone=870]\n**Who:**\n- Nanokik [npc=41297]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Ry`Gorr overseer [npc=41614]\n- a Ry`Gorr watchman [npc=41618]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:02:44 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Nanokik ( map) at 460, 555, -262 (this is in the Ry'Gorr area, a long distance from the zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Nanokik'\nNanokik says 'Oh, my goodness! It's funny seeing someone new down here. What are you doing here? Are you friends with the Ry`Gorr? That's a nice weapon, by the way, where did you get it? Does it do anything interesting? I used to have a pretty nice weapon too, although I lost it when the Ry`Gorr [captured] me.'\nYou say, 'Captured?'\nNanokik says 'Yes, \\*sigh\\*, that's why I'm down here with a pick axe. Normally, I'm much more interested in tinkering than chipping away at bits of stone. I tried telling one of the overseers that if I had my tools and a few scraps of metal, I could make a mining-device that could get this done much faster, but he didn't seem interested. I think he's just being [stingy].'\nYou say, 'Stingy?'\nNanokik says 'The overseers and watchmen have my tools. They took them from me when I was captured, and divvied them up. I think they've been using them as novelty toothpicks. Anyway, they refuse to give them back. If you could get my tools for me, though, I know where I can find some old pick axes to use as scrap metal. Then I could build a mining-device and get this done in no time!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A More Efficient Operation'.\nNanokik has asked you to recover her tools from the Ry'Gorr Overseers and Watchman, so she can build a mining device to more efficiently mine for crystals.\n\n---\n\nRecover Nanokik's tools from the Ry'Gorr Watchmen or Overseers 0/6 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Note: There is no actual item here. It's a random update on kills._\nReturn to Nanokik 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
