      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Crystal Caverns, Fragment of Fear [zone=870]\n**Who:**\n- Fridjorn [npc=41298]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a crystal crawler [npc=41597]\n- a crystal webmaster [npc=41600]\n- a crystal webspinner [npc=41601]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:03:50 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Fridjorn ( map \\- full zone map) at /location -345, 20, -527 (in the crystal crawler caverns in the far southern part of the zone)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Fridjorn'\nFridjorn says 'Help... me... I'm so [hungry]. I don't even have... the strength to stand up, anymore.'\nYou say, 'Hungry?'\nFridjorn says 'I've seen it in my dreams... a famine is coming, but nobody will believe me... Please! You must help! We desperately need [food] if we're to survive.'\nYou say, 'Food?'\nFridjorn says 'If you could gather some meat from the nearby spiders, that would be a great service. But be careful - in my dreams, I saw... an ill [omen].'\nYou say, 'What omen?'\nFridjorn says 'Dracnids... Their very presence poisons the air itself, tainting anything around it... Once started, the evil spreads quickly... If you encounter a Dracnid while carrying any spider meat, you must immediately discard the exposed, topmost piece... So it does not contaminate the rest.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rations for the Irrational'.\nFridjorn has asked you to collect meat from the crystal crawlers, but to beware of drachnids, which may contaminate your meat supply.\n\n---\n\nKill spiders and crystal crawlers, and collect their meet. But watch out for Drachnids! 0/6 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Note: This isn't an actual item, but random updates upon kills._\nReturn to Fridjorn 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
