      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Crystal Caverns, Fragment of Fear [zone=870]\n**Who:**\n- Veldmir Velweaver [npc=41301]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Tranquilizer Darts [item=108684]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Derron Coldmist [npc=41627]\n- a Ry`Gorr watchman [npc=41618]\n- a crystal crawler [npc=41597]\n- a spinechiller spider [npc=41619]\n- a tentacle terror [npc=41621]\n- an icy leech [npc=41625]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:05:18 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task that begins with Veldmir Velweaver ( map \\- full zone map) in the Crystal Caverns (Fragment of Fear). He is found in a room in the northwest part of Froststone at location -170, 300, -399._\nYou say, 'Hail, Veldmir Velweaver'\nVeldmir Velweaver says 'Hello \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Please excuse the mess.' The dwarf gestures to the many [corpses] at his feet, 'Had I known I was going to have visitors, I might have cleaned the place up a bit.'\nYou say, 'What corpses?'\nVeldmir Velweaver says 'Oh, these are much more than corpses! They're a crucial part of my ongoing [research].'\nYou say, 'Research?'\nVeldmir Velweaver smirks, 'Oh don't be coy! You've been here long enough to notice changes in the native population. Spiders, tentacles, and even a few coldain have been touched by fear! Captain Dunstan is doing his part to figure out the cause, and I'm doing my part to figure out a [cure].'\nYou say, 'What cure?'\nVeldmir Velweaver nods fervently, 'Something needs to be done to reverse the effects, or we'll all lose our minds to fear. That is not a scenario any of us want to witness. I've been conducting experiments in an attempt to isolate the fear and remove it, but it is very difficult obtaining test subjects. The creatures within the caverns are all so hostile. It's almost impossible to collect a [living sample] for my studies.'\nYou say, 'A living sample?'\nVeldmir Velweaver says 'I need a control subject, a creature that has not been tainted. I will also need a subject that is already contaminated with the essence of fear. All must be docile and living, which will prove to be difficult without [Tranquilizer Darts].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Subdued Subjects'.\nVeldmir Velweaver is trying to create a cure for the fear that is plaguing Crystal Caverns, but to do so, he needs living test subjects.\nYou'll need tranquilizer darts to subdue the test subjects. Derron Coldmist should be willing to craft them.\nYou say, 'What about the tranquilizer darts?'\nVeldmir Velweaver says 'Do you not have any Tranquilizer Darts yet?' The coldain scientist sighs, 'Well then, I suggest you speak to Derron Coldmist. I know he's very busy, but I'm sure if you collect the raw materials he'll be willing to make you some. You'll then use the darts to subdue the test subjects and lure them back to me.'\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Derron Coldmist 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Derron Coldmist ( map \\- full zone map) is found in the southern part of Frostone (upper level) at /location -315, 200, -383._\nYou say, 'Hail, Derron Coldmist'\nDerron Coldmist nods as you make your request for tranquilizer darts, 'I can make those, but I'll need a few things first. Bring me an icy tentacle and a crystal venom sac and I will craft your darts.'\nRetrieve an icy tentacle 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\nRetrieve a crystal venom sac 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\nReturn to Derron Coldmist 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\nUse the darts to subdue a Ry`Gorr watchman and lure it to Veldmir Velweaver 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Right-click the dart on a Ry`Gorr watchman. It will become your pet. Lead it back to Veldmir. (Note: You can't invis or fade or you lose the pet.)_\nUse the darts to subdue a spinechiller spider and lure it to Veldmir Velweaver 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Right-click the dart on a spinechiller spider. It will become your pet. Lead it back to Veldmir. (Note: You can't invis or fade or you lose the pet.)_\nSpeak to Veldmir Velweaver 0/1 (Crystal Caverns)\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience (2 AAs)",
